        "readable_text": "Prompt:\n[MATH: (\\tan \u03b8 \u22c5 \\sec \u03b8)/(1 + \\tan^{2} \u03b8) =]\n\nChoices:\na. [MATH: \\sin \u03b8]\nb. [MATH: 1 \u2212 \\sin \u03b8]\nc. [MATH: \\sin^{2} \u03b8]\nd. [MATH: \\sin^{2} \u03b8 + 1]\ne. [MATH: 1 + \\sin \u03b8]"
